  "prefLabel": "He-A 707.09 Films and Resource Materials",
  "priorExpiration": "2006-11-16",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-A 707.09 Films and Resource Materials.\n\n(a) Providers shall use only those films and resource materials approved by the department, according to the procedure and criteria described in He-A 707.05(b) and (c).\n\n(b) New films or resource materials may be used subsequent to department approval.\n\nSource. #6653, EMERGENCY, eff 12-12-97, EXPIRED 4-11-98\n\nNew. #6753, eff 5-20-98; ss by #8624, INTERIM, eff 5-20-06, EXPIRES: 11-16-06; ss by #8749, eff 11-16-06",
